<%- layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="about-page container">

  <!-- ====================== Header  ====================== -->
  <div class="about-header text-center">
    <h2 class="about-title">About BookLoop</h2>
  </div>

  <!-- ====================== Problem We Solve  ====================== -->
  <section class="about-card">
    <h5 class="about-section-title">Problem We Solve</h5>

    <p class="about-text">
      Every semester, students buy expensive textbooks that are used only once
      and then forgotten on shelves. Meanwhile, other students struggle to find
      affordable study materials.
    </p>

    <p class="about-text">
      Traditional marketplaces are not designed specifically for students,
      making textbook exchange difficult, unorganized, and inefficient.
    </p>
  </section>


  <!-- ====================== Solution  ====================== -->
  <section class="about-card mt-4">
    <h5 class="about-section-title">Our Solution</h5>

    <p class="about-text">
      BookLoop connects students within academic communities to easily
      sell, exchange, or donate textbooks. Instead of letting books go unused,
      BookLoop helps circulate knowledge from one student to another.
    </p>

    <p class="about-text">
      The platform focuses on simplicity, affordability, and sustainability
      while building a trusted student network.
    </p>
  </section>


  <!-- ====================== How BookLoop Works ====================== -->
  <section class="about-card mt-4">
    <h5 class="about-section-title">How BookLoop Works</h5>

    <div class="how-steps">

      <div class="how-step">
        <span class="step-number">1</span> 
        <div>
          <h6>List Your Book</h6>
          <p>Add book details, condition, and exchange preference.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step">
        <span class="step-number">2</span>
        <div>
          <h6>Browse Listings</h6>
          <p>Students explore available books based on course and semester.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step">
        <span class="step-number">3</span>
        <div>
          <h6>Send Request</h6>
          <p>Interested users request books directly from owners.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step">
        <span class="step-number">4</span>
        <div>
          <h6>Complete Exchange</h6>
          <p>Students connect and complete the exchange offline.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ======================  Key Features  ====================== -->
  <section class="about-card mt-4">
    <h5 class="about-section-title">Key Features</h5>

    <ul class="about-features">
      <li>📚 Student-focused textbook marketplace</li>
      <li>🔁 Sell, exchange, or donate books</li>
      <li>🎯 Course & semester-based discovery</li>
      <li>💬 Request and messaging system</li>
      <li>📱 Fully responsive modern interface</li>
    </ul>
  </section>


  <!-- ======================  Future Vision  ====================== -->
  <section class="about-card mt-4">
    <h5 class="about-section-title">Future Vision</h5>

    <p class="about-text">
      BookLoop aims to become a complete academic sharing ecosystem where
      students can exchange not only textbooks but also notes, resources,
      and learning opportunities.
    </p>

    <p class="about-text">
      Future improvements include smarter search, verified campuses,
      recommendation systems, and stronger student collaboration tools.
    </p>
  </section>

</main>